  "text": "[calm] One agent, one turn, only makes so much. This poured-bronze layer is the answer — reach. [short pause] Watch the build seat: it hangs a whole sub-pipeline. Several takes forged in parallel, judged blind, the best synthesized into the shipped asset. Sound is judged by numbers — the judge's brief is honest about it: you cannot hear — the analysis is how you judge. [pause] Then the baton: a builder holding a swing too big for one turn hands it, mid-work, to a fresh builder. Bounded — three handoffs, and the last one must finish. Makers stopped shying from big work. [short pause]\n\n\n\nHere is that idea, as stone. An empty yard.\n\nOne maker sets the springers — and is gone.\n\nFresh hands raise the voussoirs, course by course.\n\nAnother hand drops the keystone.\n\nAnd the ring goes rigid — a thing none of them could have finished alone.",
